msgstr ""
":func:`~numpy.clip` to skrót dla ``maximum(lo, minimum(a, hi))`` -- nasyca "
"wartości do zakresu::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:32
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.maximum` and :func:`~numpy.minimum` take two operands and "
